  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5Ri1IxW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"577\" height=\"319\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Добавляет такие напитки, как чай с жемчужинами и кофе, которые готовятся на машинах из мода Create.</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Более 40 вкусов для автоматизации!</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5ltNTbl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"603\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M2UUrec.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"237\"></p>\n<p><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/AWuqkC9Xmx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/previews/006/892/625/original/discord-logo-icon-editorial-free-vector.jpg\" alt=\"Discord Logo Icon editorial vector 6892625 Vector Art at Vecteezy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/dev_myst\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/previews/002/534/045/original/social-media-twitter-logo-blue-isolated-free-vector.jpg\" alt=\"Twitter Bird Icon Vector Art, Icons, and Graphics for Free Download\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><br></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Требуется:</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Для получения дополнительных вкусов:</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-trees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pams Harvestcraft 2 Trees</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-crops\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's Harvestcraft 2 Crops</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/croptopia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Croptopia</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Atmospheric</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/environmental\" rel=\"nofollow\">Environmental</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autumnity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Autumnity</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Другие рекомендуемые моды на еду:</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seasonals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Seasonals (требуется Atmospheric и Autumnity)</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/peculiars\" rel=\"nofollow\">Peculiars (требуется Atmospheric)</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-food-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's Harvestcraft 2 Food Core</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-food-extended\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's Harvestcraft 2 Extended (требуется Pam's Trees и Crops)</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\">Перейдите на страницу Issues в GitHub для предложений или сообщений об ошибках.&nbsp;</span></strong></span><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\">Она находится на четвёртой вкладке этой страницы под названием «Issues»</span></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Примечание: поддержка версии 1.16 прекращена, и обновлений для неё, скорее всего, не будет</span></p>",
